        <arrangement id="aspace_c588de05e4fdb61655804db3687feeb5">
          <head>Arrangement</head>
          <p>The first run of correspondence is arranged alphabetically by correspondent. The second run of correspondence is arranged by the correspondents' country of origin and other subjects. Filed at the end of the series is various correspondence not included with the others.</p>
        </arrangement>
        <scopecontent id="aspace_11607bcaf12233de462b58d31e567ef4">
          <head>Scope and Contents</head>
          <p>Series I consists of files of correspondence and other material shedding light on Chopin's development as an artist.</p>
        </scopecontent>
